1
00:00:01,360 --> 00:00:02,420
[intro] Ninety seconds on the clock

2
00:00:04,340 --> 00:00:07,850
[intro] Down the rabbit hole, tick, tick, tock

3
00:00:10,449 --> 00:00:13,320
[verse1] Ping in the burrow, my ears stand tall

4
00:00:13,440 --> 00:00:16,700
[verse1] "Small fix," fourteen thousand lines in all

5
00:00:16,960 --> 00:00:19,380
[verse1] Nested ternaries, a function called "fix"

6
00:00:19,720 --> 00:00:22,720
[verse1] Forty-six console logs left in the mix

7
00:00:23,420 --> 00:00:26,840
[verse1] A secret key committed, plain as day

8
00:00:27,320 --> 00:00:30,060
[verse1] The tests all pass 'cause they're skipped anyway

9
00:00:32,220 --> 00:00:35,720
[chorus1] Three little comments on your PR (hop! hop!)

10
00:00:35,880 --> 00:00:38,920
[chorus1] Did anybody read a single one? (nope! nope!)

11
00:00:38,986 --> 00:00:41,960
[chorus1] Click, click, resolve all, thumbs up, amen

12
00:00:42,539 --> 00:00:47,800
[chorus1] Hop, hop, guess I'll write 'em all again (held: again)

13
00:00:47,880 --> 00:00:50,620
[verse2] Sixty seconds, force-push on the branch

14
00:00:50,980 --> 00:00:54,000
[verse2] Whole review gone, never had a chance

15
00:00:54,220 --> 00:00:57,260
[verse2] You said "it's never null" like you're the king

16
00:00:57,560 --> 00:01:00,760
[verse2] I drew a diagram, you didn't read a thing

17
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:04,020
[verse2] You typed "CodeRabbit, pause," like I'm to blame

18
00:01:04,620 --> 00:01:09,500
[verse2] I wrote a poem for you all the same (held: same)

19
00:01:09,600 --> 00:01:12,880
[chorus2] Forty little comments on your PR (hop! hop!)

20
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:16,060
[chorus2] Did anybody read a single one? (nope! nope!)

21
00:01:16,161 --> 00:01:19,100
[chorus2] Click, click, resolve all, thumbs up, amen

22
00:01:19,360 --> 00:01:25,300
[chorus2] Hop, hop, guess I'll write 'em all again (held: again)

23
00:01:27,740 --> 00:01:30,520
[bridge] Line nine thousand twelve, now what is this?

24
00:01:31,120 --> 00:01:33,600
[bridge] Unsanitized input, there it is

25
00:01:34,460 --> 00:01:37,300
[bridge] I flagged it red, in all caps, with my paw

26
00:01:37,700 --> 00:01:44,800
[bridge] You clicked on merge and then you shipped the flaw (held: flaw)

27
00:01:44,940 --> 00:01:48,240
[final_chorus] Four hundred comments on your PR (hop! hop!)

28
00:01:48,380 --> 00:01:51,380
[final_chorus] So now you wanna read a single one? (yep! yep!)

29
00:01:51,440 --> 00:01:54,780
[final_chorus] It's three a.m., prod's down, who could've known?

30
00:01:54,860 --> 00:01:59,900
[final_chorus] You scroll back to my comment and you groan (held: groan)

31
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:02,250
[final_tag] As mentioned above.

32
00:02:05,560 --> 00:02:06,700
[outro_spoken] As mentioned above.
